      "Abstract": {
        "CopyrightInformation": "Copyright © 2010 Sociedad Española de Neumología y Cirugía Torácica. Published by Elsevier Espana. All rights reserved.",
        "AbstractText": "A total of 16 articles (Table 1), were published in the Archivos de Bronconeumología in the past year (December 2008 to November 2009), 9 of which were Originals, which was 17.6% of the originals published in that period. Fortunately, the tendency of a decreasing interest in asthma by pneumologists does not seem to have materialised as was feared a few years ago, on the contrary it seems that research is increasing. All articles that appeared in the journal during the period mentioned are reviewed."
      },
